meta {
  name: Get Audit Submission
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-submissions/{{auditSubmissionId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Dev-User-ID: {{devUserId}}
}

docs {
  Returns full detail of one audit submission, including form responses, evidence file
  metadata, app and version context. Auditor role required.

  Validation / behaviour:
    1. Auditor role required; parse submission ID — 404 if invalid UUID or not found.
    2. Load submission → AppVersion → App to resolve the owning org.
    3. Cross-org rule: auditor may not inspect a submission from their own org (403).
       PlatformAdmin bypasses this check.
    4. Return full submission object with form_responses, evidence_files, auto_validation_state,
       auto_validation_errors, and nested app + version context.

  Responses:
    200 OK                     — full submission detail
    401 unauthorized           — unauthenticated
    404 not_found              — submission not found
    403 same_org_audit_forbidden — auditor belongs to the submitting org
}
